{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43729","headline":"句 · 李范","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清猨啼远木，白鸟下前滩。\n鹤归秋汉远，人去草堂空。\n虽当南北路，不碍往来人。\n钓叟无机沙鸟睡，禅师入定白牛闲。\n天涯故友无来信，窗外拒霜空落花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李范","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43729.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43729","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}